    "title": "Rate-half exceptional-only quotient Forney-numerator normal form",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "For every minimal quotient support T of size h on the official exceptional-only face, all source weights are reconstructed by a unique polynomial F with deg F=h-3, leading coefficient Theta_2, and gcd(F,A B_T)=1: omega_t=F(t)/(A(t)^2 B_T'(t)). The same F interpolates beta_a q_1(a)A'(a)B_T(a) on every exceptional root. Exact saturation makes q_1 nonzero there. This is the exact general-distance GRS/Forney key equation and specializes to the distance-three barycentric formula.",
